flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Analysis["analysis<br/>输出: analysis_result, requirement_spec"]
    Analysis --> Ambiguity["ambiguity_router<br/>判定是否需要前置澄清"]

    Ambiguity -->|需要澄清| ClarifyReview["clarification_review<br/>生成/冻结 review_request"]
    Ambiguity -->|无需澄清| Retrieval["retrieval<br/>输出: retrieval_bundle"]

    ClarifyReview -->|pending / interrupt| ClarifyReview
    ClarifyReview -->|answered| ClarifyApply["clarification_apply<br/>回写 requirement_spec / analysis_result"]
    ClarifyReview -->|not_required / assumed| Retrieval

    ClarifyApply -->|reject| End1([END])
    ClarifyApply -->|continue| Retrieval

    Retrieval --> ArchPlan["architecture_planning<br/>输出: decomposition_result, architecture_plan"]
    ArchPlan --> ArchReview["architecture_review<br/>架构骨架评审"]

    ArchReview -->|pending / interrupt| ArchReview
    ArchReview -->|answered| ArchApply["architecture_feedback_apply<br/>回写需求侧约束"]
    ArchReview -->|not_required / assumed| Subsystem["subsystem_planning<br/>输出: subsystem_plan_map"]

    ArchApply -->|feedback / clarify| ArchPlan
    ArchApply -->|approve| Subsystem
    ArchApply -->|reject| End2([END])

    Subsystem --> Assembly["global_assembly<br/>输出: assembled_graph_ir"]
    Assembly --> Coding["coding<br/>输出: compiled_artifact"]
    Coding --> Verify["verification<br/>输出: verification_report, final_output"]
    Verify --> RepairRouter["repair_router<br/>按 scope 与预算裁决"]

    RepairRouter -->|accept| End3([END])
    RepairRouter -->|reject| End4([END])
    RepairRouter -->|planning_repair / assembly_repair / compile_repair| RepairAgent["repair_agent<br/>局部修补上游对象"]

    RepairAgent -->|resume subsystem_planning| Subsystem
    RepairAgent -->|resume global_assembly| Assembly
    RepairAgent -->|resume coding| Coding
    RepairAgent -->|END| End5([END])
